/**
 * The everyday products the catalogue looks for in all four supermarkets.
 *
 * Each row: [term, English label, menu section, Findit search, must, not, options]
 *   must   words every product name has to contain (regular expressions on the
 *          name in lowercase without accents, so "champiñón" is "champinon")
 *   not    words that rule a product out (a flavour, a ready meal, another cut)
 * Options: aliases (more words people type), fresh (fruit and veg: labels are
 * often missing, so the name decides), replace (re-match a term already in the
 * catalogue with this stricter rule).
 *
 * scripts/fetch-findit-more.mjs reads it and keeps a term only when it finds a
 * product in every shop, all with the same nutrition label within a small margin.
 */

